This license covers the project's own source code and documentation. It does
NOT cover the bundled font, which carries its own separate license:

- Noto Sans Arabic (src/assets/fonts/noto-sans-arabic-variable.woff2) is
  licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 — see src/assets/fonts/OFL.txt.
  The OFL is not affected by, and does not affect, this MIT license; the font
  must continue to ship with its OFL notice.

The Public Sans (identity face) and Geist Mono (code face) faces are fetched
and self-hosted by next/font at build time (not committed to this repository)
and are likewise licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, carried in their
own font metadata.
